      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتفدهُ</span></b> : see 4, ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He exacted, took,</i> or
<i>received, it fully,</i> or <i>wholly</i> (K) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتفد مِنْ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدْوِهِ</span> <i>He exacted the full,</i> or <i>utmost, rate of
his running.</i> Said with reference to a horse.
(M, L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتفد اللَّبَنَ</span> <i>He drew forth the
milk.</i> (K.)

